/optimized/3X/9/8/98c77c62eb63646c97eb875d73ecdc9703ef5ccf_2_690x183.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"lNxYgxp9uCrXgaISXucG0qFRYhp\" width=\"690\" height=\"183\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/8/98c77c62eb63646c97eb875d73ecdc9703ef5ccf_2_690x183.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/8/98c77c62eb63646c97eb875d73ecdc9703ef5ccf_2_1035x274.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/8/98c77c62eb63646c97eb875d73ecdc9703ef5ccf_2_1380x366.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"959595\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1792×476 61.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
