      "cooked": "<p>new custom field “Enable Warehouse Item Group Rules” at doctype Stock settings.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/b/6bf791253de3ebb19e0efb4f318e8983cbe070b3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6bf791253de3ebb19e0efb4f318e8983cbe070b3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/b/6bf791253de3ebb19e0efb4f318e8983cbe070b3_2_690x361.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fp7uWFMlWnXvPND6Mzv2r3BXczN\" width=\"690\" height=\"361\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/b/6bf791253de3ebb19e0efb4f318e8983cbe070b3_2_690x361.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/b/6bf791253de3ebb19e0efb4f318e8983cbe070b3_2_1035x541.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/b/6bf791253de3ebb19e0efb4f318e8983cbe070b3_2_1380x722.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1712×897 115 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
