      "created_at": "2026-01-13T16:13:01.253Z",
      "cooked": "<h2><a name=\"p-491082-official-release-announcement-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491082-official-release-announcement-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>(Official Release Announcement)</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/tada.png?v=15\" title=\":tada:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":tada:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>I’m happy to announce the official release of a new app on the Frappe Marketplace</strong></p>\n<p>After working closely with businesses managing warehouses and inventory,<br>\nI’m excited to introduce:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Warehouse Item Group Rules</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/package.png?v=15\" title=\":package:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":package:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>A common challenge</strong><br>\nMany companies struggle with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Raw materials stored in the wrong warehouses</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finished goods mixed with other inventory</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Human errors caused by workload or manual checks</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Time wasted fixing stock issues and audits</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/red_circle.png?v=15\" title=\":red_circle:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":red_circle:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> The result?<br>\nConfusing inventory data and operational inefficiencies.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>How the app helps</strong><br>\nInstead of relying on manual supervision, the system prevents mistakes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Each warehouse accepts only the correct type of items</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Incorrect stock entries are blocked instantly</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Rules are enforced automatically for all users</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/green_circle.png?v=15\" title=\":green_circle:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":green_circle:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>The business impact</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Clean and organized inventory</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fewer stock errors</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Faster audits</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Smoother daily operations</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/pushpin.png?v=15\" title=\":pushpin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":pushpin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Now officially available on the <strong>Frappe Marketplace</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/link.png?v=15\" title=\":link:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":link:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://cloud.frappe.io/marketplace/apps/warehouse_item_group_rules\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://cloud.frappe.io/marketplace/apps/warehouse_item_group_rules</a></p>\n<p>If your business manages warehouses, manufacturing, or distribution,<br>\nthis app helps prevent inventory problems before they happen.</p>\n<p><a class=\"hashtag-cooked\" href=\"/c/erpnext/6\" data-type=\"category\" data-slug=\"erpnext\" data-id=\"6\" data-style-type=\"square\"><span class=\"hashtag-icon-placeholder\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-square-full svg-icon svg-node\"><use href=\"#square-full\"></use></svg></span><span>ERPNext</span></a> <a class=\"hashtag-cooked\" href=\"/tag/frappe\" data-type=\"tag\" data-slug=\"frappe\" data-id=\"96\" data-style-type=\"icon\" data-icon=\"tag\"><span class=\"hashtag-icon-placeholder\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-square-full svg-icon svg-node\"><use href=\"#square-full\"></use></svg></span><span>frappe</span></a> <a class=\"hashtag-cooked\" href=\"/tag/inventorymanagement\" data-type=\"tag\" data-slug=\"inventorymanagement\" data-id=\"336\" data-style-type=\"icon\" data-icon=\"tag\"><span class=\"hashtag-icon-placeholder\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-square-full svg-icon svg-node\"><use href=\"#square-full\"></use></svg></span><span>inventorymanagement</span></a> <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#BusinessEfficiency</span></p>",
